  "description": "A real-world political and social organization founded in Egypt in 1928, which has branches in many Muslim-majority countries. It is often associated with Islamist political movements and has been designated as a terrorist organization by some governments, including the United States and Egypt. The meme uses this group to imply a connection with 'hackers', which is a stereotype used to vilify and demonize the group.",
